19 December 2017   1-6-5
      Released with EPICS set to: V3.14.15.7

27 December 2017   1-6-6
      * Merged back into trunk some bugfixes and improvements.
      * Introduced the use of Init Hooks to time various aspects of the
        driver initialization.

28 December 2017   1-6-7
      This version fixes for good the "variable timezone" bug. While the
      causes of the variability are still not clear, the fix makes sure
      that the Bancomm driver returns always UTC timestamps.
